{"id":"3202245608","kind":"answer","title":"用双链笔记软件做的笔记会很杂乱吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2023-09-08","updated":"2023-09-08","votes":143,"comment_count":4,"minutes":4,"chars":2000,"keywords":["常青笔记","间隔重复","知识工作","助记媒介","笔记写作"],"summary":"写双链笔记的人，也会做大纲节点，把一个主题下的笔记整理出来。 比如 Andy 的笔记（汉化两百余篇） § 严肃研究知识工作（Stripe 融合讨论，2019-12-12） §笔记写作系统 §收件箱与注意力管理 助记媒介（Mnemonic medium） 笔记类型体系 间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition mem…","question_detail_html":"<p>Logseq没有文件夹整理，没有标签列表。倡导不管什么类型的内容都写在日志里，完全靠链接组织内容。这样的笔记不会很乱吗？</p><p>卡片工作法第一步当然是建立碎片知识点的连接，但是第二步还是要整理成组织有序的形式。为什么双链笔记软件不做第二步呢？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/567492650/answer/3202245608","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"比如 Andy 的笔记（汉化两百余篇）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"§ 严肃研究知识工作（Stripe 融合讨论，2019-12-12）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"§笔记写作系统"},{"id":"sec-4","level":3,"title":"§收件箱与注意力管理"},{"id":"sec-5","level":3,"title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）"},{"id":"sec-6","level":3,"title":"笔记类型体系"},{"id":"sec-7","level":3,"title":"间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）"},{"id":"sec-8","level":3,"title":"§最关心的事情"},{"id":"sec-9","level":3,"title":"灵感源泉在何方？"},{"id":"sec-10","level":3,"title":"倾听自己的想法很难"},{"id":"sec-11","level":3,"title":"让思想和信念有机地涌现"},{"id":"sec-12","level":2,"title":"在写作时创建推测性大纲"},{"id":"sec-13","level":2,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-14","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-15","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"bpGiOBzV\">写双链笔记的人，也会做大纲节点，把一个主题下的笔记整理出来。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">比如 Andy 的笔记（汉化两百余篇）</h2><h3 id=\"sec-2\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"599606352\" href=\"#/post/599606352\">§ 严肃研究知识工作（Stripe 融合讨论，2019-12-12）</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cdeb2deae80de30e34793e569e042777_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f8e82aa4c58b4dea45b8f8919d5740ba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f8e82aa4c58b4dea45b8f8919d5740ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1330\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cdeb2deae80de30e34793e569e042777_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f8e82aa4c58b4dea45b8f8919d5740ba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f8e82aa4c58b4dea45b8f8919d5740ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1330\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-3\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"533129885\" href=\"#/post/533129885\">§笔记写作系统</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-57d4c0b0f783fdfcde16a25b9b254012_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-664dbb06d244ab344fc51cb081bba1ca\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-664dbb06d244ab344fc51cb081bba1ca_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1160\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-57d4c0b0f783fdfcde16a25b9b254012_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-664dbb06d244ab344fc51cb081bba1ca\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-664dbb06d244ab344fc51cb081bba1ca_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1160\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-4\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"501187896\" href=\"#/post/501187896\">§收件箱与注意力管理 </a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ffa87864ccace0a376b0a073042326c1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2ba0d74fe7d5e3185a8b6833050d8b8c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2ba0d74fe7d5e3185a8b6833050d8b8c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1094\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ffa87864ccace0a376b0a073042326c1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2ba0d74fe7d5e3185a8b6833050d8b8c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2ba0d74fe7d5e3185a8b6833050d8b8c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1094\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-5\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d5d0e3b83784ba2c4f164d5627ef4189_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2c6ee7fba28b386a70740dbfb3667ed7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2c6ee7fba28b386a70740dbfb3667ed7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1426\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d5d0e3b83784ba2c4f164d5627ef4189_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2c6ee7fba28b386a70740dbfb3667ed7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2c6ee7fba28b386a70740dbfb3667ed7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1426\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-6\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"542384570\" href=\"#/post/542384570\">笔记类型体系</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-b101225df7210ddd22d3ae78fd231a1a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-1ea5137dae5875a453c320b478e32d0c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1ea5137dae5875a453c320b478e32d0c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1464\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-b101225df7210ddd22d3ae78fd231a1a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-1ea5137dae5875a453c320b478e32d0c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1ea5137dae5875a453c320b478e32d0c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1464\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-7\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-e38cd71e72a2ce4fdbbd8c0032b4bb1e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8df34f4abde3b659925567463ee84aa0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8df34f4abde3b659925567463ee84aa0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"898\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-e38cd71e72a2ce4fdbbd8c0032b4bb1e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8df34f4abde3b659925567463ee84aa0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8df34f4abde3b659925567463ee84aa0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"898\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-8\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"608096379\" href=\"#/post/608096379\">§最关心的事情</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-74eeb7077aeba833dd425647e482888c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-63d576bc2b118bfc8e9ddd2f04839684\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-63d576bc2b118bfc8e9ddd2f04839684_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1140\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-74eeb7077aeba833dd425647e482888c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-63d576bc2b118bfc8e9ddd2f04839684\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-63d576bc2b118bfc8e9ddd2f04839684_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1140\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-9\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"571702216\" href=\"#/post/571702216\">灵感源泉在何方？</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-16c485e2bc1e03f71e608c48fc876927_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e2979f582461310146eaa4ea085a3040\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e2979f582461310146eaa4ea085a3040_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1434\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-16c485e2bc1e03f71e608c48fc876927_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e2979f582461310146eaa4ea085a3040\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e2979f582461310146eaa4ea085a3040_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1434\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-10\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"642001316\" href=\"#/post/642001316\">倾听自己的想法很难</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4278282907f15ba4a2d9340e4c93d1db_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7a86b3c73c34897f0fe74d526f9fa431\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-7a86b3c73c34897f0fe74d526f9fa431_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1408\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4278282907f15ba4a2d9340e4c93d1db_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7a86b3c73c34897f0fe74d526f9fa431\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7a86b3c73c34897f0fe74d526f9fa431_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1408\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-11\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"447217141\" href=\"#/post/447217141\">让思想和信念有机地涌现</a></h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5c3f70a6818c12f4d8f98f8b29ecb19d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-85544932d5db909e04d460a12493d90f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-85544932d5db909e04d460a12493d90f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1010\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5c3f70a6818c12f4d8f98f8b29ecb19d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-85544932d5db909e04d460a12493d90f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-85544932d5db909e04d460a12493d90f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1010\"/></figure><hr/><p data-pid=\"Nr_Ourkg\">关于这些笔记是怎么写出来的，Andy 自己也有写一些相关笔记，这里贴一篇和问题正好相关的：</p><h2 id=\"sec-12\">在写作时创建推测性大纲</h2><p data-pid=\"9I3ewvUd\"><br/>每写一条新笔记时，把它添加到你正在维护的一个或多个<b>大纲</b>中，有必要的话也可以创建新的大纲。非常完整的写作项目会自然从中涌现。</p><p data-pid=\"W51RPuNd\">通常情况下，当我们开启一个写作项目时，我们会先列大纲。这迫使我们从一张空白页开始。相比之下，如果我们每天都写新的笔记，并留意它们之间的联系，这些笔记可以积累成潜在的写作项目。当感觉大纲「成熟 」时，我们就可以收获，把它变成手稿，这个过程不像从空白页开始写作那样需要付出巨大的努力才能启动。</p><p data-pid=\"YJkf33-8\">将已经写好的笔记加入到大纲中是相对容易的：只要比对一下笔记，然后问自己：哪一个在前面？(Pirsig)</p><p data-pid=\"yUqOej-E\">此外，从一份空白的大纲出发去写作，需要我们预先想好主题和思考的角度。我们可以<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6Mx6PrJjGCf2akGM9pvoZ5Nk3EozcZcc9zHx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">使用笔记来避免先入为主的结论</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-13\">参考文献</h2><p data-pid=\"oDyM2ien\">Ahrens, S. (2017). <i>How to Take Smart Notes: One Simple Technique to Boost Writing, Learning and Thinking – for Students, Academics and Nonfiction Book Writers</i>.</p><blockquote data-pid=\"OGjtlCbL\">敞开心扉寻求洞见的第一步，也是最重要的一步，就是将我们发现论点和想法的工作方式从自上而下变为自下而上。<br/><br/>史蒂芬·约翰逊（Steven Johnson）写了一本关于科学界和一般人如何提出真正新想法的书，并称其为“慢直觉”。作为利用这种直觉的前提条件，他强调了实验空间的重要性，在那里，各种想法可以自由交融（Johnson,2011）。思想开放的研究人员所在的实验室就可以成为这样一个空间，就像知识分子和艺术家在老巴黎的咖啡馆里自由地讨论思想一样。此外，卡片盒也是这样一个空间，在那里，各种想法可以自由交融，从而诞生新的想法。<br/><br/>「如果某件事暂时停滞不前，我就将它放置一边，转头去做别的事情。」有人问他在被项目卡住时还会做什么，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2uXyfV67dnWLUKg1iDbsrHk3DGjtNWTxSTah\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">卢曼</a>回答道，「嗯，写其他的书。我总是齐头推进不同的稿件。这样同时推进不同项目，我从来不会遇到心理障碍。」</blockquote><p data-pid=\"NmOk3Yx8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://zettelkasten.de/posts/write-book-without-even-trying-so-hard/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">如何写书——甚至不用努力（那么多）• Zettelkasten 方法</a></p><blockquote data-pid=\"_1X2lT5Q\">当我创建一个 Zettel 时，我会在文件夹中寻找一个可以利用这个 Zettel 的大纲。如果没有找到适合的大纲，我就会新建一个。<br/><br/>现在，我只是不断地在没有任何具体意图的情况下阅读文本和创造 Zettels，就可以看到文章、书籍和其他写作项目的自然涌现。<br/><br/>我提到的关于写作的书就是这样出现的。我在写一本关于营养学的书，所以我决定研究如何写书和常规写作。 我将每一个笔记转换成 Zettel 的同时都将之添加到了大纲中合适的位置。一段时间后，我对该主题的阅读需求得到了满足。当我看着大纲时，我意识到我的笔记已经可以成书了。我用 Zettels 的内容替换了 ID。如你所见。一份手稿已经准备好了。</blockquote><p data-pid=\"P0FmxJmE\">Pirsig, R. M. (1991). <i>Lila: an inquiry into morals</i>. New York: Bantam Books.</p><blockquote data-pid=\"yhu0YTyq\">他所要做的不是问：「这个宇宙的本质从哪里开始？」——一个实际上无法回答的问题。他所要做的是看着两条笔记，然后问自己：「哪条应该放在前面？」这个问题就很简单了，他总是能得出一个结论的。接着他便看向第三条笔记，将之与第一条笔记进行比较，再问一次：「哪条应该放在前面？」如果新笔记应该在第一条笔记之后，那就再与第二条进行比较。然后他就有了一个三条笔记构成的组织。面对一条又一条的笔记，他不断地重复着这个过程。</blockquote><h2 id=\"sec-14\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"q7sXWCvJ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"428784607\" href=\"#/post/428784607\">常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位</a></li><li data-pid=\"6jEokN6l\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"440755692\" href=\"#/post/440755692\">可执行的写作策略</a></li><li data-pid=\"T-CG7N8_\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"443990718\" href=\"#/post/443990718\">常青笔记是发展大胆想法的安全场所</a></li><li data-pid=\"gefkZCUu\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"422262632\" href=\"#/post/422262632\">笔记标题建议使用完整的句子，避免模糊主张</a></li><li data-pid=\"jVxtOI9V\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"447217141\" href=\"#/post/447217141\">让思想和信念有机地涌现</a></li><li data-pid=\"GPdCFlSZ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"451268598\" href=\"#/post/451268598\">如何将阅读标注处理成常青笔记</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-15\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"Q85we5fr\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"tK0x7ymH\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2uXyfV67dnWLUKg1iDbsrHk3DGjtNWTxSTah\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Create speculative outlines while you write (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 使用笔记来避免先入为主的结论 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"445418007\" href=\"#/post/445418007\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"404257681","title":"间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":88,"minutes":16,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"642001316","title":"倾听自己的想法很难","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":31,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"533129885","title":"§ 笔记写作系统","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":29,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"542384570","title":"笔记类型体系","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":28,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"501187896","title":"§收件箱与注意力管理","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":27,"minutes":1,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"416319260","title":"常青笔记（Evergreen notes）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":188,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"428784607","title":"常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":25,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"427460683","title":"「更好地记笔记」这个描述太过流于表面；核心在于「更好地思考」","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"450488015","title":"笔记写作的反馈不足","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":20,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"422894427","title":"知识工作应能聚沙成塔","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":4,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2772990761","title":"如何构建自己的笔记系统？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":755,"minutes":20,"reason":"相似问答 · 755 赞同"},{"id":"2831205170","title":"记笔记真的有用吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":174,"minutes":5,"reason":"相似问答 · 174 赞同"},{"id":"3366385830","title":"卡片笔记写作法是否被过誉了？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":132,"minutes":5,"reason":"相似问答 · 132 赞同"},{"id":"2834967811","title":"如何高效内化读过的书？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":210,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 210 赞同"},{"id":"2845247815","title":"为什么大多数人行动力很低甚至没有？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":401,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 401 赞同"}]}